OL,3,ATwo detained after French influencer's
OL,4,Ascorched body found in vineyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been detained after a
OL,7,Fyoung woman's burned body was found in
OL,8,Fa vineyard in southern France, the
OL,9,Flocal prosecutor has said.
OL,11,FIn a statement on Wednesday, Nimes
OL,12,Fprosecutor Cecile Gensac confirmed the
OL,13,Fbody found in the Saint-Gilles vineyard
OL,14,Fbelonged to social media influencer
OL,15,FSonia Bellina.
OL,17,FThe 29-year-old had a following of
OL,18,Faround 260,000 on TikTok and was
OL,19,Fvisiting her family in the area a month
OL,20,Fbefore her 30th birthday.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
