OL,3,ATwo detained after French influencer's
OL,4,Ascorched body found in vineyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two men were taken into police
OL,7,Fcustody on Wednesday due to "evidence
OL,8,Fsuggesting their direct or indirect
OL,9,Finvolvement in the incident", the
OL,10,Fprosecutor said.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
